#: src/routes/_home/-sections/prefooter.tsx
msgid "Reactive Resume gets better because people give it their time. Contributors on GitHub build the features and fix the bugs, translators on Crowdin make it readable in other languages, and donors help keep development going. This project owes its progress to all of them."
msgstr "Reactive Resume kļūst labāks, jo cilvēki tam velta savu laiku. Līdzautori GitHub vidē veido funkcijas un labo kļūdas, tulkotāji Crowdin vidē padara to lasāmu citās valodās, bet ziedotāji palīdz turpināt izstrādi. Šis projekts par savu izaugsmi ir pateicīgs viņiem visiem."

#: src/routes/_home/-sections/donate.tsx
msgid "Reactive Resume is a free and open-source project, maintained by me and a community of contributors. Your donations cover the running costs and keep development going."
